  "image": "/images/posts/8517.webp",
  "content": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">En dependencias de la Escuela Encarnación Olivares se desarrolló una significativa jornada de celebración del Día del Alumno, organizada por el Programa Modalidad Flexible 2026 del Ministerio de Educación, ejecutado por Los Lagos EDUCATE y apoyado por la Ilustre Municipalidad de Maullín <img alt=\"🙌\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfd/1/16/1f64c.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La actividad reunió a cerca de 75 estudiantes adultos de los niveles de 8° Básico, 1° y 2° Medio, y 3° y 4° Medio, quienes cada sábado participan activamente de sus clases presenciales junto a docentes y equipo de coordinación <img alt=\"👏\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfe/1/16/1f44f.png\"/><img alt=\"📖\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t9e/1/16/1f4d6.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Durante la jornada se vivieron momentos de compañerismo, encuentro y alegría, fortaleciendo los lazos entre estudiantes y profesores y reafirmando la importancia de continuar avanzando en sus procesos educativos <img alt=\"🤝\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t64/1/16/1f91d.png\"/><img alt=\"✨\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf4/1/16/2728.png\"/></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👏\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfe/1/16/1f44f.png\"/> Felicitamos a cada uno de nuestros alumnos y alumnas por su compromiso, esfuerzo y perseverancia en este importante camino de superación personal y formación académica.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-46 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8518\" data-id=\"8518\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/w7ka8khe7oy5mrc/alumno_adult_01_1024x683_krjr9xacob.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8521\" data-id=\"8521\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/r0g4uhem89ocy55/alumno_adult_02_1024x683_qwx55se6dk.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8520\" data-id=\"8520\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/eoiegf3yzeruc7m/alumno_adult_03_1024x683_4ixreg4csb.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8522\" data-id=\"8522\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/qe1chy0clez1vqi/alumno_adult_04_1024x683_hf6lf6n93d.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8525\" data-id=\"8525\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ncyoyiw9v67ifr4/alumno_adult_05_1024x683_bqj3ycidex.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8524\" data-id=\"8524\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/lc6daawhocz7d0b/alumno_adult_06_1024x683_cehnj95m3f.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8523\" data-id=\"8523\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/316xplzwddjqk4f/alumno_adult_07_1024x683_765luvm2kg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-8519\" data-id=\"8519\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/ixuwdiq3k2wtvrk/alumno_adult_08_1024x683_5ttdevls9t.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n</figure>"
